        {"zh": "冰层下面是软草", "en": "Soft grass waits under the ice."},
        {"zh": "我第一次看见这片雪原", "en": "I see this snowfield for the first time."},
        {"zh": "一出生就跟着队伍", "en": "I join the herd the moment I am born."},
        {"zh": "小蹄子踩进了雪窝", "en": "My little feet sink into the snow."}
